{"id":"vod_bf_31494","vodId":"31494","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"噬血狂袭第一季","name_cn":"噬血狂袭第一季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第24集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-32/744d89c6fb12fd568b6fc74a2c1de174.jpg"},"summary":"世界最强吸血鬼与剑巫少女所编制的故事现在，开幕——！！“第四真祖”——那是本应只存在于传说中的，世界最强的吸血鬼。驾驭着十二只眷兽、播撒灾厄的幻之吸血鬼，出现在了日本。为了监视、抹杀那个“第四真祖”，政府·狮子王机关决定派遣被称为“剑巫”的攻魔师。然而不知为何，被选为监视者的，却是见习中的“剑巫”少女，姬柊雪菜。雪菜携带着专门对真祖使用的最强灵枪，造访魔族特区“弦神市”。在那里遭遇到的“第四真祖”晓古城的真实身份是——！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:49:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/shixuekuangxidiyiji/第14集/in